**Path:** `/workspace/repo/pinot-core/src/main/java/org/apache/pinot/core/query/aggregation/groupby/DictionaryBasedGroupKeyGenerator.java`

Constructor (lines 105-107) takes `int numGroupsLimit`; `_globalGroupIdUpperBound` is derived from it. In the non-overflow int-array path (line 175): `_globalGroupIdUpperBound = Math.min((int) cardinalityProduct, numGroupsLimit);` — so it is capped by numGroupsLimit.

